#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "570192"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571544"
msgid "She tried to execute the captured Masters\nto lure in #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571664"
msgid "…that strategy is definitely working.\nI ended up hurrying down here in a panic."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571868"
msgid "Was having her #C000246204SG#CDEF extracted THAT humiliating――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571968"
msgid "………no.\nI'm not all that angry about having my #C000246204SG#CDEF\nextracted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572908"
msgid "Decidedly, it's in the name of my third #C000246204SG#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573088"
msgid "―――Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573104"
msgid "Y-you're telling me THAT'S why she\nhates me enough to kill me―――!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573288"
msgid "I'm not taking a single complaint from you.\nI'm #C236196003BB#CDEF's #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF, anyhow. We're mutual enemies."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573784"
msgid "#C236196003Lancer#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573816"
msgid "W-wait, before this, didn't she just casually\ndrop something huge on us!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574536"
msgid "Huh? #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF, is it?\nI've never heard of such a minor brand name."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575468"
msgid "…#C236196003Elizabeth Báthory#CDEF.\nThe blood-soaked countess who once existed in Hungary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575632"
msgid "So that was this young lady's True Name."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "576252"
msgid "Why torture others so much?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "576288"
msgid "Why are you so hung up on youth?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "576324"
msgid "Why are you so… idol?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576356"
msgid "Why, you ask?\nAnd just why do you ask THAT?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577024"
msgid "I'm not hung up on it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578020"
msgid "The more I reign them in, the more women weep."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578152"
msgid "\"Women\" are slaves, mothers, lovers, and\nmaterials which possess beauty. In short, food."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578328"
msgid "Peeking out of her mouth are irregular dragon teeth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579496"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580304"
msgid "♪So gimme some of that\n    Killer☆Killer-brand jam!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580488"
msgid "…\nIn spite of her mellifluous voice, her pitch is\nall over the place, and her lyrics don't make a lick of sense."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580616"
msgid "Yep. Maybe there isn't a god in this world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581124"
msgid "…what a sad Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581160"
msgid "#C236196003Archer#CDEF shakes his head lightly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581304"
msgid "Sorry, Master. I couldn't help being dumbstruck."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581452"
msgid "No doubt."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581464"
msgid "Making us hear this perdition of a song,\nthen attacking us while she's befuddled our minds―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581856"
msgid "Just how cruel IS this Servant!?\nA hoarse voice would be preferable at\nthis point!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581944"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF hangs her tail, realizing something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582148"
msgid "Ah―me…… tone-deaf!?!?!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582344"
msgid "? A gorilla… and a whale?\nGori… ale?\nGoriale?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582584"
msgid "No encore!\nA song where you sputter blood and die is no\nnormal song to begin with!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582968"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF is unusually raring to go…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583144"
msgid "\"G-Golden P.\"?\nWh-what the… What a Gorgeous name."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583600"
msgid "Yes, of course, #C236196003Rani#CDEF.\nI'll take the rest off your hands."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585760"
msgid "Ha―――Ghh―――!\nA little pain… like this―――\nNo, I won't give in to any pain―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585852"
msgid "…remember this.\nI'm an immortal, ageless, eternal, supreme idol."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585924"
msgid "I WILL return, and I'll drag you,\n#[pig][squirrel]#, straight down to hell…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586816"
msgid "You must have already experienced this,\n#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF. There's only one way to\ndefeat me, a #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587156"
msgid "I won't run or hide.\nNo, for me, this is where the show starts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587276"
msgid "I am #C236196003Rani #RUBSEighth#RUBEVIII#REND#CDEF.\nEarth's last and perfect homunculus created by\nalchemists."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591144"
msgid "…is she sure about that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591480"
msgid "You'll go *pop*. *squeeze*. *squoosh*. *squish*.\n…like that. Just come touch me, gently…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591924"
msgid "However, they also serve to expose the\nemotions and addictions that normally control a person."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592088"
msgid "Since #C236196003Rani#CDEF's have all been exposed,\neverything about her is saying:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592340"
msgid "…hmph."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592448"
msgid "When two people's opinions differ, the one\nwith the least legitimacy must bear the shame."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592704"
msgid "I-is that so…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593104"
msgid "Therefore, please do as I say.\nPromise me this, and I'll release you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593176"
msgid "…now I see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593452"
msgid "I'm not talking about strength.\nIt's my intellect that far exceeds yours…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593816"
msgid "Will entrust all the chaos of the world to me,\nthe mother computer; big brother."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594412"
msgid "Ah, no…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594724"
msgid "What #C236196003Rani#CDEF calls \"objective\" means \"what I think.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594800"
msgid "\"Logical\" means \"this is what I like.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594864"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF likes to have everything go her way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595488"
msgid "I'm also… not weari―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595516"
msgid "Anyone can tell that I'm lying, so why is #C236196003Rani#CDEF so delighted?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595680"
msgid "…! Ah―I'm just acknowledging that\nyou've finally understood that I'm rational!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595960"
msgid "―――Damn! Did I phrase it wrong!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596416"
msgid "A \"perverted exhibitionist\"…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596448"
msgid "Hyah…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596736"
msgid "I mean… I'm superior to human beings… see?\nWhat I feel to be pleasurable,\nis intense and correct…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596840"
msgid "Now I'm going to prove it beyond any doubt…\nLet's play a game, #[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "597724"
msgid "Cheat Gamer"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597924"
msgid "Damn, I was wrong…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598076"
msgid "HAAaaAA…!\nNo! It's a lie―――\nAhh, but it feels good―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598344"
msgid "My third eye has opened at last, my mentor…\nHumanity must dress lighter―MUCH lighter."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598876"
msgid "First, I need to correct that mistake she's made.\nI harden my heart and say―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599036"
msgid "Wonderful… Thank you for your approval.\nI finally got my ideas across to you…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599116"
msgid "Damn! That's not hardening my heart…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599228"
msgid "KyaaAaaa!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599332"
msgid "But it's the truth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599444"
msgid "And anyway, #C236196003Rani#CDEF is also a Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599584"
msgid "You're… not wrong to conclude that―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599784"
msgid "No, \"frustration\" is no pointless emotion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599828"
msgid "It leads to a mind that grows and self-reflects."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601024"
msgid "I feel hot, cold, good…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601060"
msgid "Could this be…\nwhat it feels like to like something…?\nNo, that's not allowed…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601384"
msgid "And yet, why…\nis this so breezy…?\nWhat do I do…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602192"
msgid "I like #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602232"
msgid "I like it breezy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602432"
msgid "…no. You no longer have any chances.\nI'm now firmly set."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603136"
msgid "The world is growing dark…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603216"
msgid "…now there's no way out.\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF's words failed to reach her―――"
msgstr ""

